 ['MOVE   Arrows / A D     JUMP   Space / W\nFIRE   J / X     TERMINAL / BOARD   E\nMECHA SHIELD   Hold K     PAUSE   P / Esc\n\nExplore upward, downward and across rooms.\nCollect 3 parts; repair 3 separate terminals [E].\nPredict outputs, fix circuits and build logic.\nTest every case, then confirm each repair.\nMecha unlocks in sector 6; bosses in 7 and 8.','GERAK   Panah / A D     LOMPAT   Spasi / W\nTEMBAK   J / X     TERMINAL / NAIK MECHA   E\nPERISAI MECHA   Tahan K     JEDA   P / Esc\n\nJelajahi ruangan ke atas, bawah, dan samping.\nKumpulkan 3 komponen; perbaiki 3 terminal [E].\nPrediksi keluaran, perbaiki, dan rakit rangkaian.\nUji semua kombinasi, lalu konfirmasi perbaikan.\nMecha tersedia di level 6; penjaga di level 7 dan 8.'],
